d fragments that piece together the puzzle of Mateus's torment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Exploration &amp; Mystery:</strong> Interact with the environment, find items, and discover paths to delve deeper into this dark dimension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Short &amp; Intense Experience:</strong> Developed by a two-person team, the game offers a focused and impactful journey of approximately <strong>90 minutes to 2 hours</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639950/extras/04ce0f7736e411043de61374be4cc55d.poster.avif?t=1771621282\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639950/extras/04ce0f7736e411043de61374be4cc55d.webm?t=1771621282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639950/extras/04ce0f7736e411043de61374be4cc55d.mp4?t=1771621282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f SENSITIVE CONTENT WARNING:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game deals with extremely heavy and mature themes that may be distressing or act as triggers for some players. The central narrative directly addresses depression and suicide. The experience also contains depictions of physical torture and psychological violence. Strong player discretion is advised.</i></p>","developers":["Walter O. M. Junior"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639950/550653715457d53d0d2cb923139ac65b24e66011/header.jpg?t=1771621282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2639950/49990521/b9c82b7285e